{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565070/extras/74548cd34d5a8df4eb4f062deb0c5b89.avif?t=1757866257\" data-has-big width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565070/extras/84e1497fdf35b0446e0a14b67330bfe0.avif?t=1757866257\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cybernoir</strong> is a <i>cyberpunk</i> <strong>open-world action sandbox game</strong>. Step into the shoes of a nameless <strong>detective</strong>, navigating a dark <strong>neo-noir</strong> city of the future. Take on a wide variety of missions: eliminate high-value targets, solve brutal <strong>crime cases</strong>, hunt down criminals, and battle ruthless gangs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sprawling open world filled with intrigue, corruption, and criminal underworlds awaits. Every alley hides new dangers and opportunities. Make morally challenging choices that shape the story and your relationships with powerful factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the city on foot or by vehicle, upgrade your gear and abilities, and uncover hidden locations. Engage in dynamic <strong>third-person action</strong> or strike from the shadows. <strong>Cybernoir</strong> offers a unique blend of intense combat, nonlinear storytelling, and immersive <strong>detective gameplay</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of <strong>detective games</strong>, <strong>story-driven action games</strong>, <strong>cyberpunk worlds</strong>, and <strong>open-world sandbox experiences</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Step into the back-alley clinic \u2014 where the right implant can change your fate.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565070/extras/aed3f1f2dbc0cd89664a016e0568a5ef.poster.avif?t=1757866257\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565070/extras/aed3f1f2dbc0cd89664a016e0568a5ef.webm?t=1757866257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565070/extras/aed3f1f2dbc0cd89664a016e0568a5ef.mp4?t=1757866257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Upgrade your body, sharpen your edge \u2014 in Cybernoir, power comes at a price.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565070/extras/4a4db420d7740419169a37fc48c13809.poster.avif?t=1757866257\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565070/extras/4a4db420d7740419169a37fc48c13809.webm?t=1757866257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565070/extras/4a4db420d7740419169a37fc48c13809.mp4?t=1757866257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Defy gravity in a police hovercar \u2014 justice takes to the skies.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565070/extras/b5ef3899230f24d9a5404e0ccb80ab37.poster.avif?t=1757866257\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3